sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant U as 👤 User
    participant Shell as 🏠 Shell MFE
    participant Orders as 📦 Orders MFE
    participant NGINX as ⚖️ NGINX
    participant GW as 🚪 API Gateway
    participant OS as 📋 Order Service
    participant PG as 🐘 PostgreSQL
    participant RMQ as 🐰 RabbitMQ
    participant Kafka as 📡 Kafka
    participant NS as 📨 Notification Service
    participant Redis as ⚡ Redis
    participant FC as 🔗 FaaS Connector
    participant Email as 📧 Email Function

    Note over U, Email: Order Placement Flow
    
    U->>Shell: Click "Orders"
    Shell->>Orders: Load via Module Federation
    Orders-->>U: Display Menu
    
    U->>Orders: Add items to cart
    U->>Orders: Click "Place Order"
    
    Orders->>NGINX: POST /api/orders
    NGINX->>GW: Route request (round-robin)
    
    GW->>GW: Verify JWT token
    GW->>OS: POST /orders {items, userId}
    
    OS->>PG: INSERT order
    PG-->>OS: Order created
    
    par Publish to Kafka
        OS->>Kafka: Publish ORDER_CREATED event
    and Publish to RabbitMQ
        OS->>RMQ: Publish to order.events queue
        OS->>RMQ: Publish to notification.queue
        OS->>RMQ: Publish to email.queue
    end
    
    OS-->>GW: 201 Created {order}
    
    par Notification Processing
        RMQ->>NS: Consume notification.queue
        NS->>Redis: PUBLISH notification channel
        Redis->>GW: Pub/Sub notification
        GW->>Shell: WebSocket push
        Shell->>Orders: Update UI
        Orders-->>U: Show "Order Created" toast
    and Email Processing
        RMQ->>FC: Consume email.queue
        FC->>Email: HTTP POST /function
        Email->>Email: Generate email (mock)
        Email-->>FC: 200 OK
    and Analytics Processing
        Kafka->>Kafka: Store event for analytics-service
    end
    
    GW-->>NGINX: Response
    NGINX-->>Orders: 201 Created
    Orders-->>U: Show order confirmation
